## interests

eh its more like i randomly start doing stuff but generally most
of my likings can be classified into:

- osdev: im starting to like doing stuff from scratch
- graphics: started learning opengl and its awesome
- open source: cool shit, communism at its finest
- networking: anything that involves two devices communicating
- [creatures of steel](https://devilmayquake.com/)

### setup

- operating system: [void linux](https://voidlinux.org/)
- window manager: [niri](https://niri-wm.github.io/)
- text editor/ide: [helix](https://helix-editor.com/)

### home server

i have a server that i run, not the most reliable but works fantastic and i love it.

- [woodpecker](https://ci.furina.is-a.dev): personal ci/cd i use for this site as well as other projects.
- [git mirror](https://mirror.ririna.net): primarily for projects i like and might be interested in. i plan
  to bring back ziggymirror as well as a lazy xbps mirror but yeah.
- [copyparty](https://share.ririna.net): mostly for public shares or personal backups
- [jellyfin](https://watch.ririna.net): for friends and mostly myself

